        "thought_text": "Revisit the greedy approach for segment selection. Instead of using binary search, we can directly apply a greedy strategy to select segments that maximize the difference. For each segment, calculate the potential increase in the maximum value and decrease in the minimum value it can contribute. Sort the segments based on these contributions and greedily select segments to maximize the difference.",
