        "thought_text": "The previous approach missed the potential for more optimal solutions by considering all possible combinations of segments. A better strategy would be to use a greedy approach that considers the impact of each segment on the overall range of the array, rather than just focusing on the endpoints. Additionally, we need to consider all possible subsets of segments to find the optimal solution, which can be achieved using a bitmask approach.",
