        "thought_text": "The current approach of using a sliding window technique to track the maximum and minimum values in the array after applying segments is not sufficient. It doesn't consider the optimal way to choose segments that maximizes the difference between the maximum and minimum values after applying them. Instead, we should focus on finding the segments that contribute the most to increasing the difference between the maximum and minimum values.",
